  "finish": { "grain": 0.016, "vignette": 0.87, "glow": true, "scanlines": 0.19, "chroma": 0.085 },
  "banned": [
    "orange, amber or red as a colour: the console is cyan and magenta only (that is what keeps it apart from the orange broadcast HUD)",
    "corner brackets and timecodes: the console is a rounded, feathered screen, not a camera viewfinder",
    "invented telemetry: every log line, metric and meter value is true",
    "flat, unlit graphics: rings, nodes and the metric carry their glow",
    "type that moves once it has landed; only the system parts run (rings, logs, scan beam, dust)",
    "more than two hues of accent in one frame (cyan and magenta), and violet anywhere but the faint depth orb",
    "text in the bottom 330 px or the top 230 px; the header sits just inside the top line",
    "cuts inside a shot: the console builds in one continuous take"
  ],
